{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VortX is a casual arcade style game featuring a black hole, a space ship and asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple but challenging: Evade from the asteroids as long as you can while the singularity prevents you from actually escaping the scene. Collect and use your PowerUps wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts quite easy but it quickly gets harder over time. Can you survive more than 5 minutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Content Warning: This game makes use of stroboscopic effects and quick scene changes, which is intended. Currently it is not possible to disable these. A future update may or may not offer the option to disable some of these effects.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/995760?t=1761315316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/995760?t=1761315316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995760/ff792321cf231c3db749906011463bccfeae116a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761315316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995760/ff792321cf231c3db749906011463bccfeae116a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761315316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VortX is a casual arcade style game featuring a black hole, a space ship and asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple but challenging: Evade from the asteroids as long as you can while the singularity prevents you from actually escaping the scene. Collect and use your PowerUps wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts quite easy but it quickly gets harder over time. Can you survive more than 5 minutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Content Warning: This game makes use of stroboscopic effects and quick scene changes, which is intended. Currently it is not possible to disable these. A future update may or may not offer the option to disable some of these effects.</i></p>","developers":["Firesplash Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995760/2de556bf117100d8134a107de10a5591e5bd1e87/header.jpg?t=1761315316","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/995760/967031409/c49158c039186cce3310d50b6850b18f2373b32c/1760746247/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761241470","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/995760/967031409/c49158c039186cce3310d50b6850b18f2373b32c/1760746247/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761241470","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/995760/967031409/c49158c039186cce3310d50b6850b18f2373b32c/1760746247/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761241470","id":257219469,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219469/movie480.mp4?t=1761241470","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219469/movie_max.mp4?t=1761241470"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219469/876e048f1e43140f5657e484ca7a9ff5e5c56601/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761241470",